sequenceDiagram
    participant Job as Migrate Job
    participant Badges as Badges service
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Kafka as Kafka

    Job->>DB: drizzle migrations
    Badges->>DB: upsert badges.json into badge_catalog
    Note over Badges,DB: rows that did not change are not written
    Note over Badges: catalog cache cleared, read once on next use
    Badges->>Badges: listen on 8086
    opt any badge added or changed
        loop 1,000 users at a time, in user id order
            Badges->>DB: re-check each user in user_metrics
        end
        Note over Badges: runs in the background, health probes keep answering
    end
    Badges->>Kafka: connect producer for foc.badges.dlq
    Badges->>Kafka: join group badges-service, subscribe to four topics
    Note over Badges,Kafka: foc.order.status, foc.admin.events, foc.user.rating, foc.user.status
